  "meta": {
    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "A flying mount. mode fly makes it fly and hover when idle (hovers), with flying_speed 0.8, and it takes no fall damage. msm:rideable lets a player get on with an empty hand; once it wears a vanilla saddle (saddle true) the first rider steers it along their view, rising while they hold jump, at 1.5 times its movement speed. passengers 2 seats a second rider behind; saddle_bone shows the model's saddle bone only while it is saddled, and on_mount fires msm_examples:sky_ray_mount, a flap sound. It has no natural spawn: use its spawn egg.",
